      "special": "per-competence resolution modifiers, each named after the doc sentence that creates it"
    },
    "flags": [
      "Closed Bracket carries target:null in off-class-kits.json; the Bracket ladder is single-target throughout the doc, so it is set to 'one enemy' here — flagged for GM confirmation.",
      "Save Fourth Base and Multiple Perspective revive percentages are of max HP, per the doc ('Revive one ally at 50% HP')."
    ]
  },
